    "chunk_text": "& Sanctus Stephanus oftorfod. Her se eadiga Petrus se apostol ges\u00e6t biscepsetl in Antiochia \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre. Her onfeng Gaius rice. Her se eadiga Petrus se apostol ges\u00e6t biscepsetl on Rome. Her Herodes aswalt.se \u00fee Iacobum ofslog ane geare \u00e6r his agnum dea\u00fee. Her Claudius o\u00feer Romana cyninga Bretene lond gesohte, & \u00feone m\u00e6stan d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s ealondes on his \u00deis was \u00fees feor\u00f0es geares his rices.& on \u00feys ylcan geare gewear\u00f0 se mycela hunger on Siria \u00fee Her Iacobus frater Domini \u00ferowode. Her Marcus se godspellere for\u00feferde. Her Petrus & Paulus \u00ferowodon. Her Uespassianus onfeng rice. Her Titus Uespessianus sunu in Hierusalem ofslog Iudea cxi \u00feusenda; Her Titus feng to rice, se \u00fee s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone d\u00e6g forlure \u00fee he noht to gode on ne gedyde; Her Domitianus Tites bro\u00f0ur feng to rice. Her Iohannes se godspellere in Pathma \u00feam ealonde wrat \u00fea boc Apocalipsis. Her Symon se apostol w\u00e6s anhangen.& Iohannes se godspellere hine gereste in Epheso. Her Clemens papa for\u00feferde. Her Ignatus biscep \u00ferowude. Her Marcus Antonius & Aurelius his bro\u00f0er fengon to rice. Her Eleutherius on Rome onfeng biscepdom, & \u00feone wuldor f\u00e6stlice xv winter geheold; To \u00feam Her Seuerus onfeng rice, & ricsode xvii winter. Se Bretenlond mid dice begyrdde from s\u00e6 o\u00fe s\u00e6.& \u00fea geendode on Euerwic.",
